./results/telemetry/github-snapshot/open-issues.json:86:  "body": "<!-- mipstarre-issue-key: pr158-terminal-rounding-blueprint-followup -->\n## Context\n\nPR #158 closes the strategy-transformation, game-value stability, and\nprojective-rounding proofs from issue #98. Its third exact-head review approves\nthe mathematics and leaves four blueprint-support and documentation findings.\nThey are tracked here so the completed proof packet does not grow.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Add the completeness-of-`sqrt Q` and squared-distance triangle dependencies\n  used by the projective-rounding proof to the Chapter 14 proof graph, using\n  existing labels or clearly subordinate support nodes.\n- Restore private visibility for implementation-only declarations exposed by\n  the locality-preserving repair, or add mathematical formalization-support\n  blueprint entries for those that genuinely form reusable public API.\n- Replace the Lean-shaped `consistencyDefect (uniformDistribution Unit) ...`\n  hypothesis in the blueprint with the equivalent displayed off-diagonal\n  correlation sum.\n- Recompute stale blueprint line-range citations throughout the changed QPBT\n  modules after the support-node insertions, including `Calculus.lean`,\n  `DistanceTheorems.lean`, `StrategyClasses.lean`, and\n  `ProjectiveRounding.lean`.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- The Chapter 14 dependency list includes every direct mathematical input used\n  by the projective-rounding proof.\n- Public declarations have intentional subordinate blueprint coverage; purely\n  local implementation lemmas are private.\n- Blueprint prose states the consistency condition in mathematical notation.\n- All cited chapter ranges match the resulting files.\n- Changed-file Lean checks, blueprint checks, and full local CI pass.\n\nProvenance: PR #158 at\n`8a9619a7b4302aba7e205be6747e8224a9efb7c2`, terminal findings F1-F4.\n\n---\nAddresses #98",
